BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48 758.9000000000001 Td (- Newton gravitation: F=Gm1m2/r^2; G=6.67 x 10^-11 N m^2 kg^-2.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48 747.0000000000001 Td (- Surface gravity: g=GM/R^2; at radius r from the centre, g\(r\)=GM/r^2.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48 735.1000000000001 Td (- At altitude h: g_h/g=\(R/\(R+h\)\)^2; weight W=mg.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48 723.2000000000002 Td (- Gravitational potential energy: U=-GMm/r; small-height change near surface Delta U approx mgh.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48 711.3000000000002 Td (- Circular orbit: v=sqrt\(GM/r\); T=2pi sqrt\(r^3/\(GM\)\); hence T^2 proportional to r^3.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48 699.4000000000002 Td (- Escape speed: v_e=sqrt\(2GM/R\)=sqrt\(2gR\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48 687.5000000000002 Td (- Circular orbit total energy: E=-GMm/\(2r\); orbital kinetic energy K=GMm/\(2r\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48 675.6000000000003 Td (- Kepler's second law: equal areas are swept in equal times.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 48 663.7000000000003 Td (Use each equation only when its assumptions apply; keep units consistent.) Tj ET
